IDLE
BUSY  = 0
DONE  = 0
ERROR = 0

Waiting for:

enable = 1
BUSY
BUSY  = 1
DONE  = 0
ERROR = 0

Run:

counter = 0 → 5
DONE
BUSY  = 0
DONE  = 1
ERROR = 0

Remain here until:

enable = 0
ERROR
BUSY  = 0
DONE  = 0
ERROR = 1

Remain here until:

enable = 0
